        "text": "Exciting news from our Sales Dev team at ClickUp!\n\nCongrats to Nicholas Lopez, Emma Lancaster, Sarah James, Sarah Ali, Sarah Handfelt, and Francesca Becker on their promotions to SMB Account Executives. Watching you all grow in the BDR role and earn this next step has been awesome to see!\n\nWe currently have 26 AEs that came from our XDR org. 🚀 \n\nAlso congrats to Adam Hebert and Michael Rubly on moving up from SDR to BDR. You've both crushed it and I'm excited to see what you do next!\n\nWith these promotions, we have openings for SDR and BDR roles. If you're in San Diego or DFW and interested in a hybrid position where there's real room to grow, send me a message.\n\n#SDR #BDR",
