        "text": "I'm grateful for the professional development stipend at ClickUp. It is a huge perk to work for a company that genuinely invests in our growth.\n\nI used some of the funds this year to dive into the StackOptimise ⚙️ GTM Engineering course.\n\nI recommend it to other SDR Leaders looking for a technical breakdown of the end to end process, from building signal-based lead lists to landing the meeting with effective messaging at scale. It gave me a much better perspective on how to orchestrate tools like Clay and Make to automate so our reps can focus on higher-quality conversations.\n\nLucky to have a talented demand team (s/o Sai David Kyle Andy Vasu Katherine) already doing the heavy lifting, but it feels good to speak their language a bit better now.  Looking forward to getting into the weeds with the team and applying what I learned.\n\nAnd thanks to Felix Frank and Penn Frank for putting together such tactical content!",
