        "text": "Excited to share what the team has been building with our new ClickUp Super Agents.\n\nMost AI feels like a tool you visit.\n \nClickUp Super Agents feel like teammates you work with.\n \nThey:\n▪️ Live inside your ClickUp workspace\n▪️ Use tasks to track their work\n▪️ Retain context across docs, tasks, and decisions\n▪️ Run continuously in the background on triggers, schedules, and signals from your work\n \nYou lead. Your Super Agents go to work.\n \nLaunch video below if you want to see how it all comes together.",
