        },
        "text": "Great couple of days in San Diego spending time with our San Diego Sales Development crew #gopadres\n\nClickUp is the first Converged AI Workspace, bringing everything teams need into one place. We just hit $300m ARR and there’s a ton of opportunity to learn, grow, and make an impact.\n\nWe’re hiring for two open roles that are perfect for people looking to join a high-growth company with an innovative product, a culture of coaching and development, and a clear path for SDRs to become successful AEs:\n\n▪️ Manager, Sales Development (San Diego-based): Lead, coach, and help shape the future of our SDR team.\n▪️ Sales Development Rep (Dallas Fort Worth or San Diego): Jump in, learn fast, and grow your career.\n\nIf you’re interested or want to hear more, shoot me a message.",
